---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import ArchiveItem from '../../components/ArchiveItem.astro';
const projects = (await getCollection('work')).sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
---
<Base
  title="Glow in the Dirt → Work"
  description="Our multidisciplinary creative studio takes you from the big pitch to the big picture."
  ogImage="/assets/5f8cd88124084bd7254f02ed_OpenGraphWork.jpg"
  pageId="5f7a63237379a347bba378e3"
  bodyClass="body-3"
>
<section class="content" id="Landing"><div class="work-column" data-w-id="022b30cb-8285-fb62-6a4d-9b05f7e31df5"><div class="landing-button-container landing-container-grid" data-w-id="022b30cb-8285-fb62-6a4d-9b05f7e31df6"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-4" data-w-id="f40d19f7-1925-5f42-fa1f-3d00328caf28"><div class="line-div" data-w-id="022b30cb-8285-fb62-6a4d-9b05f7e31df7" id="w-node-_022b30cb-8285-fb62-6a4d-9b05f7e31df7-bba378e3"></div><div class="landing-column-header" data-w-id="022b30cb-8285-fb62-6a4d-9b05f7e31df8" id="w-node-_022b30cb-8285-fb62-6a4d-9b05f7e31df8-bba378e3">Work</div><div class="landing-h4" data-w-id="81c2c124-f8c0-d8f6-8cc0-21ebd17e8967" id="w-node-_81c2c124-f8c0-d8f6-8cc0-21ebd17e8967-bba378e3">From the big pitch to the bigger picture, our multidisciplinary studio makes<span class="text-span-2"> <strong class="rad" data-w-id="f1fb3afa-8cad-60be-4d13-e4009bcc3f80">radical ideas</strong> <strong class="real" data-w-id="d479eceb-f805-b0a1-f8a2-d3468f78540d">real</strong>.</span></div></div></div></div></section><div class="content-without-landing" data-w-id="5e5d6785-01e8-ea0b-bb3e-9fcad24a2aa4"><section class="section" id="capabilities"><div class="container w-container" data-w-id="d63ca8ad-2ce2-ca3b-3a40-0aba2febf629"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-5"><div class="capabilities-list-container" data-w-id="8b67b198-ccc5-32a3-3842-28f3109bca94" id="w-node-_8b67b198-ccc5-32a3-3842-28f3109bca94-bba378e3"><h2 class="content-heading-2-white">Concept + Creative</h2><div class="list-number">1⃝</div></div><div class="capabilities-list-container" data-w-id="402d6e5b-9e97-c23a-ded9-4ed86248ad69" id="w-node-_402d6e5b-9e97-c23a-ded9-4ed86248ad69-bba378e3"><h2 class="content-heading-2-white">Experience + Environment</h2><div class="div-block-7"><div class="list-number">②</div></div></div><div class="capabilities-list-container" data-w-id="a064c788-fcff-7571-8892-8ff295fe0c6f" id="w-node-a064c788-fcff-7571-8892-8ff295fe0c6f-bba378e3"><h2 class="content-heading-2-white">Virtual + Video</h2><div class="list-number">③</div></div><div class="div-block-5" data-w-id="38d0d59d-23b2-2a7a-d753-df7abd523916" id="w-node-_38d0d59d-23b2-2a7a-d753-df7abd523916-bba378e3"><div class="subheader">Capabilities</div><img alt="" class="image-3" height="13" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f5171e551f6d0734fa2c886_small-arrow-right.svg" width="14"/></div><div class="body-on-black capabilities" data-w-id="e41f63be-ff4a-32b7-dc1e-bf32d3e05dba" id="w-node-e41f63be-ff4a-32b7-dc1e-bf32d3e05dba-bba378e3">We work with artists and brands to develop projects that bring clarity to creative vision. </div><div class="body-on-black capabilities" data-w-id="8d0935b7-5f21-3330-2ab2-f83d067eeb7d" id="w-node-_8d0935b7-5f21-3330-2ab2-f83d067eeb7d-bba378e3">Our most impactful work exists in the real world. From retail to the stage, our experiences incorporate digital flexibility with physical authenticity.</div><div class="body-on-black capabilities" data-w-id="63cf4226-12ef-7b04-6584-c513033a3163" id="w-node-_63cf4226-12ef-7b04-6584-c513033a3163-bba378e3">Whether film, photo, or brand, we produce strong content for the screen. Past digital work of ours spans web, mobile, and media.</div></div><div class="w-layout-grid grid-5 fake"><div class="capabilities-list-container fake" data-w-id="d2c02d02-f0b0-55a3-2538-75276468850b" id="w-node-d2c02d02-f0b0-55a3-2538-75276468850b-bba378e3"><h2 class="content-heading-2-white">Concept + Creative</h2><div class="list-number">1⃝</div></div><div class="capabilities-list-container fake" data-w-id="d2c02d02-f0b0-55a3-2538-752764688510" id="w-node-d2c02d02-f0b0-55a3-2538-752764688510-bba378e3"><h2 class="content-heading-2-white">Experience + Environment</h2><div class="div-block-7"><div class="list-number">②</div></div></div><div class="capabilities-list-container fake" data-w-id="d2c02d02-f0b0-55a3-2538-752764688516" id="w-node-d2c02d02-f0b0-55a3-2538-752764688516-bba378e3"><h2 class="content-heading-2-white">Virtual + Video</h2><div class="list-number">③</div></div><div class="div-block-5 top-layer" id="w-node-_3774e279-12f2-36f2-9ed6-be3482506918-bba378e3"><div class="subheader">Capabilities</div><img alt="" class="image-3" height="13" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f6a6221a4a474a1391c7095_small-arrow-right-grey-3.svg" width="14"/></div><div class="body-on-black capabilities fake" id="w-node-d2c02d02-f0b0-55a3-2538-75276468851f-bba378e3">We strive to pull off stunning installations, campaigns, and projects with our spe<br/>cialized know-how. Between our talents we cover the physical, digital, and everything in-between.</div><div class="body-on-black capabilities fake" id="w-node-d2c02d02-f0b0-55a3-2538-752764688521-bba378e3">ur spatial projects are designed to act as catalysts for awe. Through thoughful design and futureproof technologies, we are creating wonder.</div><div class="body-on-black capabilities fake" id="w-node-d2c02d02-f0b0-55a3-2538-752764688523-bba378e3">We develop productions with strong creative concepts. Our experiences in live music helps us coordinate complex produciton elements.</div></div><div class="w-layout-grid grid-6" data-w-id="fe594abb-5fcf-b4f4-e83b-9a133c31812b"><div class="body-on-black capabilities mobile" data-w-id="7b013a64-d124-8831-ffc1-7546e8da7878" id="w-node-_7b013a64-d124-8831-ffc1-7546e8da7878-bba378e3">We work with artists and brands to develop projects that bring clarity to creative vision. </div><div class="div-block-8" id="w-node-_0039c254-f8c4-93d3-b33d-c0479ada0529-bba378e3"><div class="div-block-9"></div><div class="div-block-10 fender"><div class="line"></div><div class="list-item fender"><div class="text-block-3">Fender Guitars</div><div class="caption-text fender">Point of Sale experience</div></div></div></div><img alt="A rendering of our point of sale interactive installation we designed for Fender Guitars." class="image-4" id="w-node-_579c072a-8d47-9d71-53a5-d8f8398ed080-bba378e3" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f6c2cf2096e4e5a46343d0a_fender-splash-1-.png"/></div><div class="w-layout-grid grid-6-copy" data-w-id="6dec99fb-097f-54ba-2876-457e21fe516b"><div class="body-on-black capabilities mobile" id="w-node-b1bf455d-c9ef-2b27-2d8a-ad1a4ba98637-bba378e3">Our most impactful work exists in the real world. From retail to the stage, our experiences incorporate digital flexibility with physical authenticity.</div><div class="div-block-8" id="w-node-_6dec99fb-097f-54ba-2876-457e21fe516c-bba378e3"><div class="div-block-9"></div><div class="div-block-10"><div class="line"></div><div class="list-item"><div class="text-block-3">Emmit Fenn</div><div class="caption-text">Far from here Pt. II Tour</div></div></div></div><img alt="" class="image-5" data-w-id="6dec99fb-097f-54ba-2876-457e21fe5175" id="w-node-_6dec99fb-097f-54ba-2876-457e21fe5175-bba378e3" loading="lazy" src="/assets/629413a90aab97324b6dc15d_newone.jpg"/></div><div class="w-layout-grid wdii-grid" data-w-id="8b21598a-9ed7-77f2-7b62-33190af183c7"><div class="body-on-black capabilities mobile" id="w-node-_95d80910-07b0-f487-8137-6897e026f903-bba378e3">Whether film, photo, or brand, we produce strong content for the screen. Past digital work of ours spans web, mobile, and media.</div><div class="div-block-8" id="w-node-_8b21598a-9ed7-77f2-7b62-33190af183c8-bba378e3"><div class="div-block-9"></div><div class="div-block-10"><div class="line"></div><div class="list-item"><div class="text-block-3">Smog Open Studio</div><div class="caption-text">Lidar-derived digital art</div></div></div></div><img alt="" class="image-6" data-w-id="8b21598a-9ed7-77f2-7b62-33190af183d1" id="w-node-_8b21598a-9ed7-77f2-7b62-33190af183d1-bba378e3" loading="lazy" src="/assets/62941824354f09587bc85600_computer.jpg" width="720"/></div></div></section><section class="archive-section" id="archive"><div class="past-works-container w-container"><div class="w-layout-grid past-works-header-grid"><div class="archive-title-row" id="w-node-_9b97a85b-ffad-a337-7a4b-53f4ec86e272-bba378e3"><div class="archive-column client"><div class="caption-text archive client">Client</div></div><div class="archive-column project"><div class="caption-text archive">Project</div></div><div class="archive-column type"><div class="caption-text archive">Type</div></div><div class="archive-column double ourrole"><div class="caption-text archive">Our Role</div></div></div><div class="capabilities-list-container" id="w-node-_447b35c6-210f-472e-0dd1-fd0ef589ccf3-bba378e3"><h2 class="content-heading-2-white">Past Works</h2></div><div class="div-block-5" id="w-node-_447b35c6-210f-472e-0dd1-fd0ef589cd03-bba378e3"><div class="subheader">Archive</div><img alt="" class="image-3" height="13" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f6a6221a4a474a1391c7095_small-arrow-right-grey-3.svg" width="14"/></div></div><div class="collection-list-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div class="w-dyn-items" role="list">{projects.map((project) => <ArchiveItem project={project} />)}</div></div></div></section><section class="case-study-section" id="casestudy"><div class="w-layout-grid case-study-grid-fixed mobile"><div class="div-block-5 mobile"><div class="subheader">Case Study</div><img alt="" class="image-3" height="13" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f6a6221a4a474a1391c7095_small-arrow-right-grey-3.svg" width="14"/></div><div class="capabilities-list-container mobile" id="w-node-_5809d439-6352-79fe-3bbc-28a473cb3dfa-bba378e3"><h2 class="content-heading-2-white">What Day Is It?</h2></div><div class="case-study-side-container" id="w-node-f1806874-3ec9-84a5-100f-bd22201b825e-bba378e3"><div class="line-div grey"></div><div class="inline-stat first"><div class="caption-text">Client</div><div class="text-block-3 case-study">Moontower</div></div><div class="inline-stat"><div class="caption-text">Project Type</div><div class="text-block-3 case-study">Live Performance Film</div></div><div class="inline-stat"><div class="caption-text">Our Role</div><div class="text-block-3 case-study">Strategy &amp; Production</div></div><div class="line-div grey second"></div><div class="inline-stat first"><div class="caption-text">Link</div><div class="text-block-3 case-study"><a href="https://youtu.be/eYCQo-ZrwFw" target="_blank">https://youtu.be/eYCQo-ZrwFw</a></div></div><div class="line-div grey second"></div><div class="inline-stat first"><div class="caption-text">Skills</div><div class="tag-container"><div class="tag">Strategy</div><div class="tag">Production</div><div class="tag">Color</div><div class="tag">Set Design</div><div class="tag">Branding</div></div></div></div></div><div class="blog-container w-container"><div class="w-layout-grid case-study-grid-fixed"><div class="capabilities-list-container" id="w-node-_4a463e43-466c-828a-99d0-0d6b59a02f7e-bba378e3"><h2 class="content-heading-2-white fade-in">What Day Is It?</h2></div><div class="case-study-side-container" id="w-node-_4a463e43-466c-828a-99d0-0d6b59a02f81-bba378e3"><div class="line-div grey"></div><div class="inline-stat first"><div class="caption-text">Client</div><div class="text-block-3 case-study">Moontower</div></div><div class="inline-stat"><div class="caption-text">Project Type</div><div class="text-block-3 case-study">Live Performance Film</div></div><div class="inline-stat"><div class="caption-text">Our Role</div><div class="text-block-3 case-study">Strategy + Production</div></div><div class="line-div grey second"></div><div class="inline-stat first"><div class="caption-text">Link</div><div class="text-block-3 case-study"><a href="https://youtu.be/eYCQo-ZrwFw" target="_blank">Watch →</a></div></div><div class="line-div grey second"></div><div class="inline-stat first"><div class="caption-text skills">Skills</div><div class="tag-container"><div class="tag">Strategy</div><div class="tag">Production</div><div class="tag">Color</div><div class="tag">Set Design</div><div class="tag">Branding</div></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_8041c2d2-9b25-d8ad-9f93-8c18765266d3-bba378e3"><div class="div-block-5 capability"><div class="subheader">Case Study</div><img alt="" class="image-3" height="13" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f6a6221a4a474a1391c7095_small-arrow-right-grey-3.svg" width="14"/></div></div></div><div class="w-layout-grid case-study-grid-scroll"><div class="case-study-side-container mobile" id="w-node-_9975ad06-ec89-0156-d008-986f6e39bad4-bba378e3"><div class="line-div grey"></div><div class="inline-stat first"><div class="caption-text">Client</div><div class="text-block-3 case-study">Moontower</div></div><div class="inline-stat"><div class="caption-text">Project Type</div><div class="text-block-3 case-study">Live Performance Film</div></div><div class="inline-stat"><div class="caption-text">Our Role</div><div class="text-block-3 case-study">Strategy &amp; Production</div></div><div class="line-div grey second"></div><div class="inline-stat first"><div class="caption-text">Link</div><div class="text-block-3 case-study"><a href="https://youtu.be/eYCQo-ZrwFw" target="_blank">Watch →</a></div></div><div class="line-div grey second"></div><div class="inline-stat first"><div class="caption-text nan">Skills</div><div class="tag-container"><div class="tag">Strategy</div><div class="tag">Production</div><div class="tag">Color</div><div class="tag">Set Design</div><div class="tag">Branding</div></div></div></div><img alt="The opening title to Moontower's &quot;What Day Is It?&quot; live performance music video." class="image-10" data-w-id="c5fd4f6b-8fca-d367-c0b5-a9c3ad028093" id="w-node-c5fd4f6b-8fca-d367-c0b5-a9c3ad028093-bba378e3" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f77c9e91015968af2ba0e13_slider-15.jpg"/><div class="body-on-black normal" id="w-node-be9fe615-b245-1fab-27b7-ecb8e64782ce-bba378e3"><em>What Day Is It </em>is a 15-minute live performance film for electro-pop trio Moontower, featuring unreleased songs from their forthcoming EP. Each song's visual identity is ever-evolving, showing viewers the ambiguity of dusk and dawn leaving them feeling lost in time.<br/><br/>After canceling their 2020 headline tour due to COVID, we worked with Moontower to develop an alternative to the live music experience. We reached out to our production partner Eastside LED and visual designer Nicole Blue to build worlds for each song blending the line between digital and physical production. The film laid the groundwork to produce a four-night virtual tour for Moontower fans, with each show featuring unique stage production.<br/><br/>Due to new production safety regulations, the show was automated wherever possible to minimize the onsite crew. We worked closely with the band to integrate a custom live lighting and visual system with their on-stage equipment. After production, we handled everything from editing to color to titles to delivery.</div></div></div><div class="blog-container lower w-container"><div class="w-layout-grid case-study-grid-fix-2"><div class="div-block-13" id="w-node-_5477ea4d-d5cd-4a87-9872-3aa951c41e9b-bba378e3"></div><div class="div-block-14" id="w-node-c30fab74-44ab-b9df-8c63-ec43915f1f2b-bba378e3"><div class="background-video w-background-video w-background-video-atom" data-autoplay="true" data-beta-bgvideo-upgrade="false" data-loop="true" data-poster-url="/assets/5f80f059374a4176c1da46c8_compressedvid-poster-00001.jpg" data-video-urls="/assets/5f80f059374a4176c1da46c8_compressedvid-transcode.mp4,/assets/5f80f059374a4176c1da46c8_compressedvid-transcode.webm" data-w-id="7b117c4d-2f9e-e7c7-ee57-293362af56f3" data-wf-ignore="true"><video autoplay="" data-object-fit="cover" data-wf-ignore="true" id="7b117c4d-2f9e-e7c7-ee57-293362af56f3-video" loop="" muted="" playsinline="" style='background-image:url("/assets/5f80f059374a4176c1da46c8_compressedvid-poster-00001.jpg")'><source data-wf-ignore="true" src="/assets/5f80f059374a4176c1da46c8_compressedvid-transcode.mp4"/><source data-wf-ignore="true" src="/assets/5f80f059374a4176c1da46c8_compressedvid-transcode.webm"/></video></div></div></div><div class="w-layout-grid case-study-grid-scroll-2"><img alt="A behind-the-scenes shot of Tom preparing for his performance." class="image-12" id="w-node-ebe9517d-5e86-5b6c-11c8-da00ba014e79-bba378e3" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f77c9db61ff18978b120185_slider-5.jpg"/><img alt="A wide shot of the band lit brightly in front of the LED wall stage with our programmed lights in scene." class="image-9" id="w-node-ae77c638-ab82-4ddd-eca0-087b305bd91e-bba378e3" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f77c9dd952b4a1e6cb953cb_slider-9.jpg"/><img alt="Signer Jake being lit by overhead DMX light bars." class="image-11" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 692px) 100vw, 692px" src="/assets/5f77c9db133859955b024c64_slider-6.jpg" srcset="/assets/5f77c9db133859955b024c64_slider-6-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/5f77c9db133859955b024c64_slider-6.jpg 692w"/><div class="slider w-slider" data-animation="slide" data-autoplay="false" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-delay="4000" data-disable-swipe="false" data-duration="300" data-easing="ease-in-out" data-hide-arrows="false" data-infinite="true" data-nav-spacing="2" id="w-node-_35e0a69f-7a0e-2172-83dc-9e264a70e67e-bba378e3"><div class="w-slider-mask"><div class="slide-2 w-slide"><img alt="A wide shot showing the entire stage that we designed and built." class="image-14" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f77c9dc59d504a3a6786268_slider-7.jpg"/></div><div class="slide w-slide"><img alt='A closeup of Moontower bassist and drummer Tom performing in an intimate atmospheric scene from the "What Day is It?" live performance music video.' class="image-13" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f77c9aadfc361a1ee857cf7_slider-12.jpg"/></div><div class="slide-3 w-slide"><img alt="A dark and colorful closeup of Moontower's lead singer Jake in the &quot;What Day Is It?&quot; music video." class="image-15" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f77c9e961ff18458b120186_slider-14.jpg"/></div><div class="slide-5 w-slide"><img alt='A wide shot of the band in front of the LED wall stage we designed for the "What Day Is It?" live performance film.' class="image-16" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 728px, 940px" src="/assets/5f77c9e9db31667daf0c7eff_slider-13.jpg" srcset="/assets/5f77c9e9db31667daf0c7eff_slider-13-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/5f77c9e9db31667daf0c7eff_slider-13.jpg 1152w"/></div><div class="slide-6 w-slide"><img alt='A shot of Dev reflecting from the overhead ceiling during the "What Day Is It?" performance.' class="image-17" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f77c9d82548b851b1595bb1_slider-2.jpg"/></div><div class="slide-7 w-slide"><img alt="A closeup of Devon playing keys with warm lighting. " class="image-18" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f77c9dfaa7a7770e82d551d_slider-11.jpg"/></div><div class="slide-8 w-slide"><img alt="A shot of our friend and DP Gabe shooting the performance." class="image-19" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f77c9da0043e7988ad3acbe_slider-4.jpg"/></div><div class="slide-9 w-slide"><img alt='The "What Day Is It?" LED wall showing an animated graphic with Dev playing keys in front.' class="image-20" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f77c9dda1f1a0433d39caff_slider-8.jpg"/></div></div><div class="w-slider-arrow-left"><div class="w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="w-slider-arrow-right"><div class="w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div class="w-slider-nav w-round"></div></div><div class="div-block-13" data-w-id="35e0a69f-7a0e-2172-83dc-9e264a70e692" id="w-node-_35e0a69f-7a0e-2172-83dc-9e264a70e692-bba378e3"></div><div class="desktop-quote-holder" id="w-node-_2fc67fc4-4e29-6185-674e-a88443aba4ad-bba378e3"><div class="paragraph white megatitle">4 Songs, 4 Unique Looks</div><blockquote class="block-quote mobile"><span class="text-span-3">Bury Me</span><br/><span class="text-span-3">Rerun</span><br/><span class="text-span-3">Got My Way</span><br/><span class="text-span-3">Hit The Lights</span></blockquote></div><div class="div-block-15" id="w-node-_93cf05f7-5804-af48-d9fd-c6498d4c58da-bba378e3"><div class="body-on-black second-body">As an opportunity to lead from concept to execution, we worked tirelessly to master every role. This responsibility helped us create a tight-knit team capable of pulling off a project normally delivered by large productions. What Day Is It is our most involved project to date.</div></div></div></div></section><div class="bg-video-mobile" data-w-id="07db2551-4cd3-6574-0f9c-98c0602c24e9"><div class="div-block-14"><div class="background-video w-background-video w-background-video-atom" data-autoplay="true" data-beta-bgvideo-upgrade="false" data-loop="true" data-poster-url="/assets/5f80f059374a4176c1da46c8_compressedvid-poster-00001.jpg" data-video-urls="/assets/5f80f059374a4176c1da46c8_compressedvid-transcode.mp4,/assets/5f80f059374a4176c1da46c8_compressedvid-transcode.webm" data-wf-ignore="true"><video autoplay="" data-object-fit="cover" data-wf-ignore="true" id="05c6d50f-3ffe-b835-36cf-1c0570fd172d-video" loop="" muted="" playsinline="" style='background-image:url("/assets/5f80f059374a4176c1da46c8_compressedvid-poster-00001.jpg")'><source data-wf-ignore="true" src="/assets/5f80f059374a4176c1da46c8_compressedvid-transcode.mp4"/><source data-wf-ignore="true" src="/assets/5f80f059374a4176c1da46c8_compressedvid-transcode.webm"/></video></div></div><div class="mobile-quote-holder"><div class="paragraph white megatitle">4 Songs, 4 Unique Looks</div><blockquote class="block-quote mobile"><span class="text-span-3">Bury Me</span><br/><span class="text-span-3">Rerun</span><br/><span class="text-span-3">Got My Way</span><br/><span class="text-span-3">Hit The Lights</span></blockquote></div></div><section class="about-us-section" id="about"><div class="about-us-container w-container"><div class="w-layout-grid about-us-header-grid"><div class="capabilities-list-container about" id="w-node-_930ba85b-c815-bc61-c264-36c3498e0ba9-bba378e3"><h2 class="content-heading-2-white"><span class="darken-header">Go from the</span> big pitch <br/>‍<span class="darken-header">to the</span> bigger picture</h2></div><div class="div-block-5 about" id="w-node-_930ba85b-c815-bc61-c264-36c3498e0bac-bba378e3"><div class="subheader">About</div><img alt="" class="image-3" height="13" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f6a6221a4a474a1391c7095_small-arrow-right-grey-3.svg" width="14"/></div></div><div class="w-layout-grid about-us-content-grid"><img alt="Co-founders Jacob and Hunter in our dome set design." class="image-22 mobile" id="w-node-_75f87411-8bfb-8ca8-77c7-4e502f4920cd-bba378e3" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.9921875px, 939.9921875px" src="/assets/5f8398b3d461144d40096f87_TeamShot-3.jpg" srcset="/assets/5f8398b3d461144d40096f87_TeamShot-3-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/5f8398b3d461144d40096f87_TeamShot-3.jpg 1561w"/><img alt="Co-founders Jacob and Hunter in our dome set design." class="image-22 web" id="w-node-_4c44be0e-75a0-b34c-64a4-8ceacba9434e-bba378e3" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.984375px, 939.9921875px" src="/assets/5f83965190b4c5cafdb69f9d_TeamShot-1.jpg" srcset="/assets/5f83965190b4c5cafdb69f9d_TeamShot-1-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/5f83965190b4c5cafdb69f9d_TeamShot-1-p-1080.jpeg 1080w, /assets/5f83965190b4c5cafdb69f9d_TeamShot-1-p-1600.jpeg 1600w, /assets/5f83965190b4c5cafdb69f9d_TeamShot-1.jpg 1715w"/><div class="hunter-about-box" id="w-node-a936a643-3db0-48ea-2916-858492308876-bba378e3"><div class="about-line-title"><div class="text-block-4">Hunter Bryant</div><div class="caption-text about position">Head of Design</div></div></div><div class="caption-text about position lr" id="w-node-d2e9f13b-ef7b-bf48-9264-dc26713469e4-bba378e3">Left</div><div class="jacob-about-box" id="w-node-_9015b1e1-3ea4-46b9-9ed4-b42c242fc58f-bba378e3"><div class="about-line-title"><div class="text-block-4">Jacob Fishman</div><div class="caption-text about position">Head of Production</div></div></div><div class="caption-text about position lr" id="w-node-_9612066a-c3c3-42f7-ddb7-75d71816007a-bba378e3">Right</div><div class="about-line" id="w-node-b78a1ee5-5d6a-7446-ef85-bd5120c7e8b3-bba378e3"></div><div class="about-line stu" id="w-node-_98ea345c-22da-981e-87b0-55bc0740c3cc-bba378e3"></div><div class="about-line stu" id="w-node-_2ccb6d1a-3ccf-014d-82f0-49e9b9a52b0c-bba378e3"></div><p class="body light about" id="w-node-_91fa1577-479d-8e57-fe3c-862f19801905-bba378e3">Co-founders Jacob &amp; Hunter met at<a href="https://www.wired.com/2015/08/can-jimmy-iovine-dr-dre-save-music-industry/"> The USC Academy of Arts, Technology, and the Business of Innovation</a>, an experimental program founded by Dr Dre &amp; Jimmy Iovine.<br/><br/><a href="https://www.wired.com/2015/08/can-jimmy-iovine-dr-dre-save-music-industry/" target="_blank"></a>After 5 years working in live music and tech, the duo joined forces to build something bigger– Glow in the Dirt.</p><p class="body light about" id="w-node-e9ce3baf-35fb-1a8d-80c5-29a5df49ef5b-bba378e3">Our experience has taught us that great work starts with a great team. And after years of experience together, we can say that we are a great team. <br/><br/>Collaboration is at our core, so we know that our best work comes from the collective effort of our creative network. <br/><br/>With the support of our talented network, we are confident in our ability to join any project at any stage.<br/></p><p class="body light about" id="w-node-c025ec34-7c65-0db0-33cf-7417f11b6cb0-bba378e3">We’ve since set up our studio in the Arts District outside of Downtown Los Angeles. <a href="/space">Learn more -&gt;</a></p><div class="subheader about" id="w-node-a2a7d957-045f-c008-22cb-b448c973a664-bba378e3">Team</div><div class="subheader about" id="w-node-_917a98db-445a-b425-ad7a-c44d33ef1d8e-bba378e3">Studio</div><div class="subheader about" id="w-node-dc9ec8e6-56b9-edc1-9fab-64a935145de4-bba378e3">Approach</div><div class="general-description left" id="w-node-_138f3380-4ad1-381a-ce13-2967ecb37ace-bba378e3"><p class="body light">Background in design and project management for live music, installation art, and video production.</p></div><div class="general-description" id="w-node-_7c4eb69b-9d6d-93ab-7faa-30da5c2946c2-bba378e3"><p class="body light">Background in graphic design and software engineering for consumer and creative tech.</p></div></div></div></section><div class="lets-chat-section"><div class="div-block-18"><div class="div-block-16"><h2 class="heading-on-white chat">Want us on your team? Let's chat.</h2></div><div class="div-block-16"><h3 class="heading say-hi-header about"><a class="link-2" href="mailto:jacobjfishman@gmail.com?subject=Glow%20Inquiry">Say hi</a></h3></div></div></div></div><footer class="footer"><section class="about-container" id="about"><div class="div-block"><div class="columns w-row"><div class="column w-col w-col-7 w-col-stack w-col-small-small-stack"><p class="paragraph">Thanks for showing interest in Glow in the Dirt!<br/>‍<br/>Whether you are looking to rent our space, hire us for creative work, or just want to have a chat, feel free to reach out.</p><h3 class="heading say-hi-header"><a href="mailto:jacobjfishman@gmail.com?subject=Glow%20Inquiry">Say hi</a></h3></div><div class="column-2 w-col w-col-5 w-col-stack w-col-small-small-stack"><ul class="list" role="list"><li class="contact-list-block"><div class="line"></div><p class="p-header paragraph">Glow In The Dirt</p><div class="contact-list-item"><div class="caption-text">Instagram</div><p class="list-p-header paragraph"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/glowinthedirt/" target="_blank">@glowinthedirt</a></p></div></li><li class="contact-list-block"><div class="line"></div><div class="contact-list-title"><p class="list-p-header paragraph">Jacob</p><div class="caption-text">Production Lead</div></div><div class="contact-list-item"><div class="caption-text">Email</div><p class="list-p-header paragraph"><a href="mailto:jacobjfishman@gmail.com?subject=Glow%20Inquiry">jacobjfishman@gmail.com</a></p></div><div class="contact-list-item"><div class="caption-text">Instagram</div><p class="lis